{"title":"The whole body at once the teacher","description":"","path":"the-whole-body-at-once-the-teacher","grid_cols":4,"grid_rows":3,"cell_width":320,"cell_height":240,"css_class_name":"set-48","published":false,"id":"b86f5f716d6d6d8d05160200","poster":"","cells":[{"title":"Travel path Jeanine Durning, D06T04","description":"","type":"visualization","additional_fields":{"base-path":"travel-path/one-perf-one-rec-one-scene/path_D06T04_"},"id":"c36f5f716d6d6d8d05180200","poster_image":{"url":"/system/uploads/deborah_hay/Cell/poster_image/full/path-d06t04-curved-path-1.png","small":{"url":"/system/uploads/deborah_hay/Cell/poster_image/small/path-d06t04-curved-path-1.png"},"medium":{"url":"/system/uploads/deborah_hay/Cell/poster_image/medium/path-d06t04-curved-path-1.png"}},"x":3,"y":1,"width":1,"height":1},{"title":"Title PROTO","description":"","type":"title","additional_fields":{"description":"What I began to do was close the door to my room for one hour a day, and perform whatever I felt I heard. I’d listen for whatever I thought I heard, perform it, and surrender it. Those three things; listening, performing and surrendering, simultaneously for an hour. And I really don’t remember how I came up with that, how I came up with that, except that it…the reading that I was doing, at that time, was a lot about small particle physics like Fritjof Capra, at that time, and other physicists. I can’t even remember who. But I felt like they were describing, in small particle physics, what I was experiencing in my body.","title":"The whole body at once the teacher"},"id":"c86f5f716d6d6d8d05190200","poster_image":{"url":"/system/uploads/deborah_hay/Cell/poster_image/full/screen-shot-2013-05-18-at-8.22.54-am-1.png","small":{"url":"/system/uploads/deborah_hay/Cell/poster_image/small/screen-shot-2013-05-18-at-8.22.54-am-1.png"},"medium":{"url":"/system/uploads/deborah_hay/Cell/poster_image/medium/screen-shot-2013-05-18-at-8.22.54-am-1.png"}},"x":0,"y":1,"width":1,"height":2},{"titl